# 🏆 BUILDATHON SUBMISSION CONTENT (NxtWave)

### 🔹 Project Title
**AI Study Buddy – GenAI Powered Learning Assistant**

---

### 🔹 Project Description
AI Study Buddy is a web-based GenAI application that helps students understand academic concepts and practice through automatically generated quizzes. The system uses a large language model to provide simple explanations and MCQs, enabling interactive and personalized learning.

---

### 🔹 Problem It Solves
Many students face difficulty in understanding complex topics and lack instant doubt clarification. AI Study Buddy addresses this by providing real-time explanations and practice questions in an easy-to-use interface.

---

### 🔹 Tech Stack Used
- HTML, CSS
- Python (Flask)
- Groq API
- LLaMA 3.1 Instant model

---

### 🔹 How GenAI Is Used
Generative AI is used to:
- Explain user-entered topics in simple language
- Dynamically generate multiple-choice quizzes
- Adapt responses based on user input

---

### 🔹 Key Features
- Concept explanation
- MCQ quiz generation
- Fast and accurate AI responses
- Clean and student-friendly UI

---

### 🔹 Future Scope
- Personalized learning paths
- Multilingual support
- Voice interaction
- Exam-specific study modes

